UID:10003044-1789146000-1789158600@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Live Music and Food Truck Night at Great Bear Vineyard
DESCRIPTION:Live Music & Food Truck Night in Davis Friday\, September 11 | 5–8:30 PM\nTicket Includes: Glass of Wine & Live Music\nStart your weekend the Great Bear way with live music\, wood-fired pizza\, estate-grown wine\, and beautiful vineyard views!\nJoin us for a relaxed Friday evening among the vines with The Teds bringing the tunes from 6–7:30 PM and Italian Brother’s Pizza serving fresh\, wood-fired pizza from 5–8:30 PM. Grab a glass of wine\, enjoy some delicious food\, and let the weekend begin!\n Music by The Teds\nWe’re excited to welcome The Teds back to the winery! This fun-loving four-piece band plays favorite oldies with plenty of upbeat\, danceable tunes. Whether you want to kick back with a glass of wine or get up and dance\, The Teds have the perfect soundtrack for your Friday night.\n Food by Italian Brother’s Pizza\nCome hungry! Italian Brother’s Pizza serves authentic wood-fired pizza made with fresh\, high-quality ingredients. Choose from a variety of classic and specialty pizzas\, all cooked to perfection in their traditional wood-fired oven.\nPlease help us support this local food truck by purchasing your dinner onsite and leaving outside food at home.\n Great wine Live music Wood-fired pizza Vineyard views\nGood food\, great music\, and a relaxing evening among the vines—what better way to kick off your weekend?
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/live-music-and-food-truck-night-at-great-bear-vineyard/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled-zK0eUQ.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
