UID:10003047-1789207200-1789216200@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Join the Harvest: Reds Edition
DESCRIPTION:Join the Harvest – Reds Edition at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis  Saturday\, September 12 | 10:00 AM\n Ticket:$30 – Includes welcome glass of sparkling\, harvest activities\, barrel tour & tasting.\nWine Club Members: Don’t forget to log in to receive your exclusive member discount at checkout!\nSip. Stomp. Savor. Smile.\nExperience harvest the way winemakers do!\nJoin us for one of the most exciting days of the year as we harvest the grapes that will become our 2026 red wines. This isn’t just a winery tour—it’s your chance to step into the vineyard\, pick the fruit\, stomp the grapes\, and celebrate the season alongside our winemaking team.\nWhether you’ve always wanted to channel your inner Lucille Ball\, capture the ultimate vineyard photo\, or simply experience the magic of harvest firsthand\, this unforgettable day is for you.\nWe’ll begin with a sparkling wine toast before heading into the vineyard to harvest grapes straight from the vines. Then it’s time for everyone’s favorite tradition—a lively grape stomp\, complete with a porrón for a little extra fun (and plenty of laughs!).\nNext\, we’ll take you behind the scenes for an exclusive winery tour and barrel tasting. We’ll have a food truck and live music to enjoy after the harvest so stick around and spend the afternoon with us! Keep an eye out to see which band and food truck will be joining us.\nYour Harvest Experience\n 10:00 AM – Sparkling welcome toast & vineyard introduction\n 10:30 AM – Hand-pick grapes for our 2026 red wines\n 11:00 AM – Grape stomp & porrón fun\n 12:00 PM – Behind-the-scenes winery tour & exclusive barrel tasting\n 12:30 PM – Stay and relax with an optional seated tasting or enjoy wine by the bottle in the vineyard while enjoying live music by Ericka Davis and food from the Greek Wagon!\nWhat to Bring\n Comfortable vineyard-ready shoes for harvesting Hat and sunscreen Flip-flops or bare feet for grape stomping A fully charged phone or camera for plenty of harvest photos\nHarvest only comes once a year\, and there’s no better way to experience it than by becoming part of the process. Come laugh\, learn\, sip\, stomp\, and celebrate the season with us at Great Bear Vineyards.\nThis isn’t just a wine event—it’s a memory you’ll be talking about long after the last grapes have been picked.
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/join-the-harvest-reds-edition-2/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled-zK0eUQ.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
