SUMMARY:UMOJA Mixer for Educators and Professionals
DESCRIPTION:The Yolo County Umoja Workgroup invites educators and professionals in the Black community to join us for an evening of connection\, community\, and celebration on September 15th in Woodland. \nJoin Umoja Yolo County for an evening of community\, connection\, and celebration. We’ll catch up with old friends\, make new connections\, celebrate the talent in Yolo County\, and discuss countywide initiatives to help families prepare students for college. We’ll also recognize the 2026 Kwanzaa honorees! Light refreshments will be served. \n📅 September 15 | 🕠 5:30–7:30 p.m.\n📍 Yolo County Office of Education\, 1280 Santa Anita Court\, Woodland\, CA 95776 \nRSVP: https://forms.gle/B51Mxwm9mrbLSe9XA
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/umoja-mixer-for-educators-and-professionals/
LOCATION:Yolo County Office of Education\, 1280 Santa Anita Court\, Woodland\, CA\, 95776
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/Umoja-Mixer.png
END:VEVENT
