SUMMARY:Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Live music at The Melon Ball in Davis. \nJoin Laurin Hunter\, Brandon “someguyBran” Dominguez and David J. Brown for an evening of original music\, storytelling and collaboration. Blending influences that span jazz\, folk\, Americana\, pop\, rock\, soul and beyond\, each artist brings a distinct musical voice while sharing a passion for authentic live performance. Together\, they’ll present an evening of original songs\, fresh interpretations of timeless classics\, creativity and connection where every performance offers something unique.
