DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T143000
SUMMARY:Healing Movement Practice
DESCRIPTION:Iama Embodied Community\nWhat if you gave yourself permission 
 to slow down\, breathe\, move\, and listen to what your body is telling yo
 u?\n\n**Healing Movement** is a trauma-informed\, embodied spiritual pract
 ice that creates space to gently connect with ourselves through movement\,
  breath\, music\, mindfulness\, and reflection.\n\nTogether\, we’ll expl
 ore movement as a way of noticing and moving through the emotions we carry
  in our bodies—whether that’s grief\, anger\, fear\, shame\, joy\, or 
 simply the everyday experiences that can be difficult to put into words.\n
 \n**No dance experience is required.** This is not a dance class\, workout
 \, or performance. There is no right way to move. You’re invited to part
 icipate at whatever level feels comfortable for you\, with an emphasis on 
 choice\, gentleness\, and listening to your own body.\n\n### What to expec
 t\n\n* Guided\, accessible movement\n* Breath and mindfulness practices\n*
  Music and periods of reflection\n* Opportunities to connect with your bod
 y and emotions\n* A welcoming\, non-performative environment\n* Freedom to
  participate in ways that feel right for you\n\nThis is a **pilot gatherin
 g**\, offered at no charge. Voluntary donations to support the iama commun
 ity are welcome\, but never required.\n\n**📅 Saturday\, September 26**\
 n**🕐 1:00 PM**\nCome as you are. Move as you’re able. There’s nothi
 ng to perform and nothing to prove.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/mindful-embodied-spirituality/events/
 316464090/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260908T001043Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260908T001043Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
